at feels relaxing, atmospheric, and spectacular while preserving its own quiet nighttime mood.\n\n#VRtravelX", "short_description": "Experience a nighttime fireworks show right by the riverbank from a striking VR perspective. In front of you, the fireworks light up the sky above the water, while behind you, the skyline rises with its towering skyscrapers. Looking around between the glowing river and the urban night scene lets you enjoy everything calmly, without crowds, and from the front row. VRtravelX turns it into an intense yet relaxing VR experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vrtravelx.net/home/VR-Travel-Urban-River-Fireworks", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRtravelX", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://vrtravelx.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25925969060390481"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1642992740490400"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1540533070540008"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1034762978976039"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1629270235004538"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1685692952592232"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "940691888320393"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "940691888320393"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792774800, "status